docs {
  # MeetingsService.GetAgenda

  The person's live sessions between two instants (at most 62 days), soonest first

  `/ltedu.meetings.v1.MeetingsService/GetAgenda` · unary · `ltedu/meetings/v1/meetings.proto`

  ## Request — `GetAgendaRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `from` | `string` | RFC 3339; empty: from now to 14 days later |
  | `to` | `string` |  |

  ## Response — `GetAgendaResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `sessions` | `repeated Session` |  |
  | `platform_available` | `bool` | Whether calls inside the platform are set up (else only Google Meet links are offered) |

  ## Tipos

  ### `Session`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `source` | `string` |  |
  | `id` | `string` |  |
  | `title` | `string` |  |
  | `context` | `string` | Subject and grade, "Tutoría virtual" or "Psicología" |
  | `starts_at` | `string` | RFC 3339 |
  | `duration_min` | `int32` |  |
  | `provider` | `string` |  |
  | `host_name` | `string` |  |
  | `is_host` | `bool` |  |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
}
